{"actions":[{"effect":{"after":"The basket sits empty, weave sagging.","gives":["note"],"message":"A wide wicker basket sits under the corner cabinet. A folded slip is tucked in the weave.","image":"/data/84303e52a8/interior-inspect-basket.jpg"},"id":"inspect-basket","kind":"inspect","target":"wicker-basket"},{"effect":{"closeup":"stacked-frames","message":"You step up to the pictures above the dresser.","reveals":["f-dresser"]},"id":"inspect-dresser-pictures","kind":"inspect","target":"stacked-frames","when":{"items":["note"]}},{"effect":{"closeup":"wall-frames","message":"You step up to the portraits beside the alcove bed.","reveals":["f-alcove"]},"id":"inspect-alcove-pictures","kind":"inspect","target":"wall-frames","when":{"items":["note"]}},{"code":"33","derivedFrom":["f-dresser","f-alcove"],"effect":{"after":"The chest drawer hangs ajar, empty.","gives":["brass-key"],"message":"The padlock clicks on the chest cabinet. A brass key glints inside.","image":"/data/84303e52a8/interior-code-chest.jpg"},"id":"code-chest","kind":"code","target":"chest-cabinet"},{"effect":{"after":"The sideboard drawer hangs ajar, empty.","gives":["iron-key"],"message":"The sideboard drawer scrapes. An iron key lies in the dust.","takes":["brass-key"]},"id":"use-brass-sideboard","kind":"use","item":"brass-key","target":"wooden-sideboard"},{"effect":{"after":"The locked door swings inward from the doorway.","message":"The locked door clicks. You slip through the doorway.","sets":["escaped"]},"id":"use-iron-exit","kind":"use","item":"iron-key","target":"open-doorway"}],"facts":[{"id":"f-dresser","kind":"count","objectIds":["stacked-frames"],"value":"3"},{"id":"f-alcove","kind":"count","objectIds":["wall-frames"],"value":"3"}],"intro":"You wake on the rug of a sunlit bedroom full of dark wood and draped curtains. You must get out through the locked doorway by the writing desk.","items":[{"description":"A small folded slip, creased and smudged.","hiddenIn":"wicker-basket","icon":"📝","id":"